## ADR numbering & canon
- New decisions get the next free `ADR-NNN`.
- A **canon** ADR (e.g. ADR-007 in the example monorepo) consolidates the live conventions and
  marks older ADRs `Superseded` — update the table in `docs/REFERENCE.md` §3.3.
- One decision = one ADR; one ADR is not a patch log or a README.